===Etymology===
1650s, from {{bor|en|fr|épistolaire}}, from {{der|en|la|*epistolarium}}, from  {{m|la|epistola||letter}} (English {{m|en|epistle}}) + {{m|la|-arium}},<ref>{{R:Online Etymology Dictionary}}</ref> from {{der|en|grc|ἐπιστολή}} from {{m|grc|ἐπιστέλλω||I send a message}} from {{m|grc|ἐπί||upon}} + {{m|grc|στέλλω||I prepare, send}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{hyphenation|en|e|pis|to|la|ry}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ɪˈpɪst(ə)ˌləɹi/}}

